Description: |
  The action-registry extension point: a shared, append-only list of `Action` objects consumed
  uniformly by every UI surface. Depends only on packages/element/src's `ExcalidrawElement`
  type; treats host application state opaquely to avoid a dependency cycle with the root
  packages/excalidraw cell (out of scope for this forest — see SCOPE.md).
